[
  {
    "translation_id": "o:stellarium:p:stellarium:r:po-stellarium-stellarium-pot--master:s:10ae5bec6bc19027ccd40d77ecaac5b6:l:sv",
    "source_id": "o:stellarium:p:stellarium:r:po-stellarium-stellarium-pot--master:s:10ae5bec6bc19027ccd40d77ecaac5b6",
    "source": {
      "other": "<b>Stellarium, directly (serial port or network)</b> is the DIRECT case. LX200-compatible and NexStar-compatible mounts can be connected either through a serial port or over a TCP/IP network (see {Device settings})."
    },
    "context": "",
    "developer_comment": "\n",
    "key": "<b>Stellarium, directly (serial port or network)</b> is the DIRECT case. LX200-compatible and NexStar-compatible mounts can be connected either through a serial port or over a TCP/IP network (see {Device settings}).",
    "pluralized": false
  },
  {
    "translation_id": "o:stellarium:p:stellarium:r:po-stellarium-stellarium-pot--master:s:aadfc6ac74b52828f98d769f25dbe350:l:sv",
    "source_id": "o:stellarium:p:stellarium:r:po-stellarium-stellarium-pot--master:s:aadfc6ac74b52828f98d769f25dbe350",
    "source": {
      "other": "<b>Connection</b> selects how Stellarium reaches the telescope. Choose <b>Serial port</b> for a device attached through a serial or USB cable. For LX200-compatible and NexStar-compatible mounts you can instead choose <b>Network (TCP)</b> to talk to the telescope over TCP/IP - for example a Wi-Fi/Ethernet adapter or a software bridge that exposes the Meade LX200 or Celestron NexStar protocol on a network port."
    },
    "context": "",
    "developer_comment": "TRANSLATORS: The text between braces is the text of an HTML link.\n",
    "key": "<b>Connection</b> selects how Stellarium reaches the telescope. Choose <b>Serial port</b> for a device attached through a serial or USB cable. For LX200-compatible and NexStar-compatible mounts you can instead choose <b>Network (TCP)</b> to talk to the telescope over TCP/IP - for example a Wi-Fi/Ethernet adapter or a software bridge that exposes the Meade LX200 or Celestron NexStar protocol on a network port.",
    "pluralized": false
  },
  {
    "translation_id": "o:stellarium:p:stellarium:r:po-stellarium-stellarium-pot--master:s:f16309f0e90f678d419db8b8fe0d16aa:l:sv",
    "source_id": "o:stellarium:p:stellarium:r:po-stellarium-stellarium-pot--master:s:f16309f0e90f678d419db8b8fe0d16aa",
    "source": {
      "other": "When <b>Network (TCP)</b> is selected, the <b>Serial port</b> field is replaced by <b>Host</b> and <b>Port</b> fields: enter the host name or IP address of the telescope (or of the computer running the network bridge) and the TCP port it is listening on. The <b>Network (TCP)</b> option is available for LX200-compatible and NexStar-compatible device models."
    },
    "context": "",
    "developer_comment": "\n",
    "key": "When <b>Network (TCP)</b> is selected, the <b>Serial port</b> field is replaced by <b>Host</b> and <b>Port</b> fields: enter the host name or IP address of the telescope (or of the computer running the network bridge) and the TCP port it is listening on. The <b>Network (TCP)</b> option is available for LX200-compatible and NexStar-compatible device models.",
    "pluralized": false
  },
  {
